At one point, while polymorphed into a black dragon (from the scale
mail) I made the mistake of experimenting to see if one could
disintegrate the floor.

The bolt of disintegration hits the floor ... -more-
The bolt of disintegration bounces ... -more-
The bolt of disintegration whizzes by you ... -more-
The bolt of disintegration hits the ceiling ... -more-
The bolt of disintegration bounces ... -more-
The bolt of disintegration whizzes by you ... -more-
The bolt of disintegration hits the floor ... -more-
The bolt of disintegration bounces ... -more-
You die ... -more-

My tombstone read  kerog-W, killed by a died.

I figured it wanted to say "killed by a disintegration blast"
but then realized that I was a black dragon and couldn't be killed
by a disintegration blast.  Unable to figure out exactly why I was
dead, it gave up and just said, in effect, "Well, he just died."

Later my administrator investigated and discovered that it was a 
definite bug, so now my tombstone reads 

kerog-w killed by a disintegration bug.

Beat that!

Keith Rogers


